<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #f7f9fc; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding: 28px 12px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;">
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 28px 18px;">
            <img
              src="<%= attachments[UserMailer::WELCOME_LOGO_FILENAME].url %>"
              alt="MatchMuster"
              width="112"
              style="display: block; width: 112px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;"
            >
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 0 34px 34px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #14213d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">Hi <%= @first_name %>,</p>

            <h1 style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25;">
              Welcome to MatchMuster!
            </h1>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">We’re delighted to have you and your team with us.</p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              MatchMuster was created to make running a football team simpler, giving you one place to organise your players, fixtures and matchday responsibilities.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>With MatchMuster Free, you can:</strong></p>

            <ul style="margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 24px;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Invite players and managers to your team</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Manage your squad and player availability</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Create fixtures and training sessions</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Select starters, substitutes, captains and set-piece takers</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Share team updates and important information</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Request and record Match Subs payments</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Keep track of match results and player statistics</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Run Player of the Match ratings and celebrate team awards</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Receive notifications about team activity</li>
            </ul>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              You can also try MatchMuster Plus, which gives managers additional tools to save time and understand their team better.
            </p>

            <div style="margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 18px; background-color: #fff2f8; border-left: 4px solid #ff0a78; border-radius: 10px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>MatchMuster Plus includes:</strong></p>

              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 24px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Automatic availability reminders</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Squad Analytics and player fitness records</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Match Subs payment analytics</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Club Finance tools for tracking income and expenses</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Recurring training sessions</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Advanced manager controls</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">The ability to create and manage multiple teams</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              Players will never need to pay to join or use MatchMuster. MatchMuster Plus is completely optional and is designed for managers who want more support with their team administration.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              To get started, invite your players using your team’s invite code, create your first fixture and ask the squad to confirm their availability.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              If you have any questions or need help setting up your team, contact us at
              <a href="mailto:support@matchmuster.uk" style="color: #2f80ed; text-decoration: underline;">support@matchmuster.uk</a>.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
              Welcome to the MatchMuster family. We’re excited to be part of your season.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0;">
              Kind regards,<br><br>
              <strong>Patrick</strong><br>
              Founder of MatchMuster<br>
              <a href="https://www.matchmuster.uk" style="color: #2f80ed; text-decoration: none;">www.matchmuster.uk</a>
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
